# Gandalf, Spark Starter: "he deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets" (CR 601.2d). Two
# targets, unequal shares: Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) takes 2 and dies, Bot2 takes the remaining 1 (19), and its Memnite,
# left untargeted, is untouched. The sibling scenario divides it as 1, 1 and 1 among three targets.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Gandalf, Spark Starter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Gandalf, Spark Starter.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Divide(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter: 2; Bot2: 1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Damage = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Gandalf, Spark Starter.Keywords = Reach
Bot1.Battlefield.Gandalf, Spark Starter.Power = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Gandalf, Spark Starter.Toughness = 3
